  "title": "Advanced pipeline: discriminative fine-tuning, QAT, stacking, a forest teacher",
  "description": "Three branches on the digits data. 1) Train a network, fine-tune it with discriminative learning rates (earlier layers learn slower), then quantization-aware training to int8, compared with the float model and post-training int8. 2) Cross-validate two networks and stack them: a logistic regression learns how to weigh them from their out-of-fold predictions. 3) Distill a random forest into a small network.",
